      "template": "<div lang=\"en\" style=\"width:100%; min-height:100vh; background:#0a0a09; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n\n  \n\n  \n\n  <main data-pagefind-meta=\"url:/en/collection/citizens-bank-of-louisiana/5-dollars/\" id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:56px 24px 80px; outline:none;\">\n\n    <a href=\"/en/collection/obsolete-united-states-banknotes/#citizens-bank-of-louisiana\" style=\"display:inline-block; color:#e7ddc4; text-decoration:none; font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.08em; margin-bottom:24px;\">&larr; Catalog</a>\n\n    <div style=\"background:#d8d2cd; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.08); border-radius:3px; padding:clamp(28px,4vw,64px); box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);\">\n\n      <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;\">\n\n        <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 40px;\">\n          <span style=\"display:block; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.22em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; margin-bottom:14px;\">Obsolete Banknote &middot; Louisiana &middot; 1860</span>\n\n          <h1 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,46px); line-height:1.08; letter-spacing:0.01em; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 12px;\">Citizens' Bank of Louisiana</h1>\n\n          <p style=\"font-size:clamp(19px,2vw,23px); font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">$5.00 &middot; Shreveport, Louisiana</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:660px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 56px;\">\n          <button\n            data-zoom-trigger=\"citizens-bank\"\n            aria-label=\"Enlarge image of the banknote\"\n            style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\"\n          >\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"/uploads/citizens-bank-louisiana-shreveport-5-dollars.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img\n                src=\"/uploads/citizens-bank-louisiana-shreveport-5-dollars.jpg\"\n                alt=\"Obsolete five-dollar banknote of the Citizens' Bank of Louisiana, Shreveport branch, obverse and reverse, 1860\"\n                width=\"564\"\n                height=\"491\"\n                loading=\"eager\"\n                decoding=\"async\"\n                style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto;\"\n              />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>Enlarge</span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Obverse (top) and reverse (bottom) — Notofilia.com Collection</span>\n<div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Country / State</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">United States/Louisiana</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Issuing Entity</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Citizens' Bank of Louisiana—Shreveport branch (<em>Banque des Citoyens de la Louisiane</em>)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Denomination</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">$5.00 (Five Dollars)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Epoch / Type</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Obsolete Banknote (<em>Obsolete Banknote</em> / <em>Broken Banknote</em>). Nicknamed &ldquo;Redback&rdquo; because of the color of its back.</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Date of Issue</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">August 23, 1860 (just before the Civil War)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Catalog Reference</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Haxby LA-15-G60a / Numista N# 334799</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Serial Number / Plate</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Period remainder (<em>Remainder</em>) / Plate D</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n          \n            <div\n              role=\"dialog\"\n              aria-modal=\"true\"\n              aria-label=\"Enlarged banknote\"\n              data-zoom-dialog=\"citizens-bank\" hidden\n             \n             class=\"catalog-zoom-dialog\">\n              <button\n                data-zoom-close\n                aria-label=\"Close\"\n                style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\"\n              >&times;</button>\n\n              <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n                <button type=\"button\" data-zoom-out\n                  disabled=\"true\"\n                  aria-label=\"Zoom out\"\n                  style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n                >&minus;</button>\n                <span data-zoom-percent style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\">100%</span>\n                <button\n                  disabled=\"false\"\n                  data-zoom-in aria-label=\"Zoom in\"\n                  style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n                >&#43;</button>\n              </div>\n\n              <div\n                style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:100vw; max-height:100vh; width:100vw; height:100vh; touch-action:none;\"\n              >\n                <picture>\n                  <source srcset=\"/uploads/citizens-bank-louisiana-shreveport-5-dollars.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n                  <img data-zoom-image\n                    src=\"/uploads/citizens-bank-louisiana-shreveport-5-dollars.jpg\"\n                    alt=\"Obsolete banknote of cinco dólares del Citizens' Bank of Louisiana, enlarged view\"\n                    draggable=\"false\"\n                    style=\"display:block; max-width:100vw; max-height:100vh; width:100vw; height:100vh; object-fit:contain; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\"\n                  />\n                </picture>\n              </div>\n\n              <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:16px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic; pointer-events:none;\">Drag to move &middot; Mouse wheel to zoom</span>\n            </div>\n          \n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px;\">\n          \n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:44px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Color Scheme</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Obverse:</strong>black ink on cream/buff security paper, with denomination markings and a large central number &ldquo;5&rdquo; printed in anti-offset green ink.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverse:</strong>full security print in deep red/orange ink, an iconic design that directly influenced Louisiana monetary culture.</p>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Vignettes and Images of the Obverse</h2>\n            <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Center:</strong>two allegorical female figures seated on agricultural products (bundles and baskets), representing commerce and abundance; In the background, to the left, you can see the chimney of a textile factory.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Left side:</strong>an oval medallion with the portrait of a period gentleman in a suit and bow tie (typically a dignitary or director of the institution).</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Right side:</strong>an oval medallion with the portrait of a young woman, with delicate flowers adorning her hair.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Upper corners:</strong>two identical green rosettes with the word &ldquo;FIVE&rdquo; crossing a stylized number &ldquo;5&rdquo;.</span>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Reverse Images</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\">It features a large red ornamental guilloché design centered on the openwork denomination &ldquo;FIVE&rdquo;, flanked by three circular counters bearing the number &ldquo;5&rdquo;.</p>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Bilingualism and Texts</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 16px;\">The bill stands out for reflecting the cultural and linguistic heritage of Louisiana:</p>\n            <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Obverse (in English):</strong> <em>&ldquo;Citizens' Bank of Louisiana at Shreveport&hellip; Will pay FIVE DOLLARS to bearer on demand.&rdquo;</em>Includes printing patent &ldquo;Patented 30 June 1857&rdquo;.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverse (in French):</strong>occupying the entire design it reads &ldquo;BANQUE DES CITOYENS DE LA LOUISIANE — SHREVEPORT&rdquo;.</span>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Signatures and Security</h2>\n            <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Signatures:</strong>being a style ticket<em>remainder</em>high quality preserved on file, the lines for the Cashier's handwritten signatures (<em>Cashier</em>) and the President (<em>President</em>) are blank.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Printer:</strong>American Bank Note Company, engraved in the lower left corner of the obverse — evidence of the use of the most advanced steel engraving technologies of the time.</span>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </section>\n\n          <blockquote style=\"margin:48px 0 0; padding:28px 0 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.15);\">\n            <p style=\"font-size:20px; font-style:italic; line-height:1.7; color:#4a4331; margin:0 0 10px;\">The Citizens' Bank of Louisiana (originally founded in New Orleans in 1833) went on to become one of the most powerful and influential financial institutions in the southern United States. Its bilingual bills—with the characteristic French reverse printed in red ink—are historically famous: the French pronunciation of the word &ldquo;Dix&rdquo; (ten) on its $10 bills issued in New Orleans gave rise to the famous term &ldquo;Dixieland&rdquo; to refer to the states of the south. This variant, issued at the Shreveport branch in 1860, is a testament to the cotton trade boom just before the start of the Secession.</p>\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33;\">&mdash; Historical Context Note</span>\n          </blockquote>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:32px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); padding-top:24px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 12px; font-style:normal;\">Sources</h2>\n            <ul style=\"margin:0; padding:0 0 0 20px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.7; color:#5c4e33; font-style:italic;\">\n              <li>Haxby, James A.<em>Standard Catalog of United States Obsolete Bank Notes, 1782&ndash;1866.</em></li>\n              <li>Heritage Auctions —<a href=\"https://www.ha.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#6b521f;\">ha.com<span style=\"font-style:italic; font-weight:400;\">(opens in a new tab)</span></a></li>\n              <li>Numista —<a href=\"https://en.numista.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#6b521f;\">numista.com<span style=\"font-style:italic; font-weight:400;\">(opens in a new tab)</span></a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </section>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  \n\n</div>",
